type: sequence
title: OAuth 2.0 Code Flow

- Browser → Auth Server: GET /authorize?client_id=… [+]

- divider: User authenticates

- Auth Server → Browser: 302 + code [-]
- Browser → Auth Server: POST /token (code) [+]
- Auth Server → Browser: { access_token, refresh_token } [-]

- divider: API call

- Browser → API Server: GET /profile (Bearer token) [+]

- alt: token valid
  - API Server → Auth Server: GET /introspect [+]
  - Auth Server → API Server: { active: true } [-]
  - API Server → Browser: { id, email, name } [-]
  - else:
    - API Server → Browser: 401 Unauthorized [-]
